1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,800
Jurus Penamat! Dalam Pahlawan Angka, setiap jawapan betul jadi serangan!

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,900
Matematik KSSR Darjah 1 hingga 6.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,500
Game ni bijak — dia tahu anak perlu improve kat mana.

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,900
Selalu tersangkut? Kemahiran Fokus kesan sendiri, dan latihan terus ke situ.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:15,900
Masuk portal…

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,700
Jawab betul, Wira serang!

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,900
Pecahkan Kunci Gangsa… Perak… dan Emas!

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
Kunci Emas? Taip jawapan sendiri.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,500
Pecah Emas… Jurus Penamat!

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,400
Nak lebih fun?

11
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,900
Terjun ke 9 mini-game!

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,100
Jadi cashier, bina bentuk, main dengan masa, cari harta… setiap topik, dunia sendiri.

13
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,900
Takdelah rasa setiap topik sama je!

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,900
Selamatkan teman, kumpul enam teman…

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,900
…dan tengok teman berevolusi!

16
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,300
Trofi untuk setiap pencapaian.

17
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,900
Mak ayah pula dapat laporan kemahiran dan worksheet PDF.

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,800
Pahlawan Angka. Jom selamatkan semua teman sambil belajar!
